 steps:[["Morning","Pushpanjali","Fast until you have offered flowers at the pandal, then eat."],["Noon","Bhog","Share khichuri bhog with the community."],["Evening","Aarti and lights","Watch the evening aarti; in Chandannagar and Krishnanagar, see the lights."]],
